    "turn_text": "likeness. And I've always been for players making money. I wish there was a way that we can make it equal for everybody, men and women, and all sports to do this. But the one thing I do not want to is for us to not have something, whether the NCAA does it, the Commissioners does it, or we do it here in federal government. I do not want us to start losing finance and for Olympic sports, women's sports, the so-called sports that have to use money that's built up by the big sports, we need to make it to where everybody can be satisfied and make it equal for everybody and still be able to have the country that we know we have in terms of college athletics because it is something that we, most of us, hang your hat on every year to watch and take pride in.",
