    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/5/65052.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "I'm sure whenever you took office, there were many other things on the agenda that you want to attempt to accomplish on your state's behalf. And you mentioned that there were coaches who were calling you looking for some type of regulation or legislation. You said, no, we're going to stay out of it. It's a pretty quick turnaround that less than a year from that moment, you feel like it's time to step in and do something. Is there a specific moment over the last year that you remember where you're like, man, this is way more than what I thought it was going to be?",
